# Who approves what. Every submission and every update to `apps/` passes through a maintainer.
# The rules, the scripts and the workflows publish with the project's credentials, so they are
# held to a smaller group.
#
# GitHub applies the last matching line, so the more specific rules come last.

*                       @appfair/maintainers

/apps/                  @appfair/maintainers
/policy.yaml            @appfair/admins
/scripts/               @appfair/admins
/.github/workflows/     @appfair/admins
/.github/CODEOWNERS     @appfair/admins
